{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14212390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1421239001:0":{"text":"이 선물은 두 분이 나눠 가지시는 게 좋겠습니다.","source_cn":"这些礼物，你们两个分吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC3736F990D3C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::1":{"text":"기억이 담긴 꽃","source_cn":"忆光花","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69CB96160004869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421239002:2":{"text":"저는 페리엘의 기억을 담은 마법의 꽃이면 충분합니다.","source_cn":"我只想要那朵承载斐利尔记忆的魔法之花。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B85B66254855BFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421239003:0":{"text":"...페리엘은 저에게 가장 친한 친구였지만, 함께 한 시간은 그렇게 길지 않았습니다.","source_cn":"……虽说和斐利尔是最好的朋友，但我们实际相处的时间却并不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43BEB877F07B27EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421239004:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 기억을 다시 볼 수 있는 방법을 가르쳐주실 수 있겠습니까?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A14B6D8A0ABD6DD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 기억을 다시 볼 수 있는 방법을 가르쳐주실 수 있겠습니까?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 기억을 다시 볼 수 있는 방법을 가르쳐주실 수 있겠습니까?","variant_male_record_index":"163405","variant_female_record_index":"163406","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421239005:1":{"text":"그렇게 하면... 가끔이라도 페리엘을 다시 볼 수 있을 테니까요.","source_cn":"这样……我至少还能偶尔看看他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9380CF292020A484","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1421239005":{"text":"그렇게 하면... 가끔이라도 페리엘을 다시 볼 수 있을 테니까요.","source_cn":"这样……我至少还能偶尔看看他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9380CF292020A484","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421239006:2":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 인듀어 님... 저는 꿈의 씨앗이 갖고 싶어요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x488D1F062B80AE69","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 인듀어 님... 저는 꿈의 씨앗이 갖고 싶어요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 인듀어 님... 저는 꿈의 씨앗이 갖고 싶어요.","variant_male_record_index":"163408","variant_female_record_index":"163409","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::3":{"text":"꿈의 식물 씨앗","source_cn":"美梦植物种子","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EC456F996120696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421239007:0":{"text":"제, 제가 페리엘 님의 꿈을 잇고 싶어요... 셀로클랜드에 진짜 땅거미 숲을 만들겠다는 꿈을요!","source_cn":"我、我想要继承斐利尔大人的梦想……在萨洛克兰，建造出一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C12F24CAF868E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421239008:1":{"text":"페리엘 님은 아름다운 지상을 정말 좋아하셨어요. 지상에 환영의 꽃도 심으셨다고 들었는데... 햇살이 내리쬐는 세계를 동경하셨거든요.","source_cn":"斐利尔大人体味过地表的美好，我听说他还在地表上种过幻影...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03833CA5D5AD30A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421239009:1":{"text":"그러니까 더 많은 사람들이 여기에서... 페리엘 님의 숲에서, 페리엘 님이 느꼈던 세상을 함께 느꼈으면 좋겠어요...","source_cn":"我想要让更多人在这里……在斐利尔大人的林地里，见一见斐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD19B39492516AEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421239010:1":{"text":"네. 그렇다면 실험의 숲은 당신에게 맡기겠습니다.","source_cn":"好，这几片实验林地，就交给你打理了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x151C5661017C97A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421239011:1":{"text":"저와 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 가끔 들리겠습니다. 작은 친구들이 외로워하지 않도록 말입니다.","source_cn":"我和<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8283012C8FBD4DE0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저와 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 가끔 들리겠습니다. 작은 친구들이 외로워하지 않도록 말입니다.","female":"저와 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 가끔 들리겠습니다. 작은 친구들이 외로워하지 않도록 말입니다.","variant_male_record_index":"163414","variant_female_record_index":"163415","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421239012:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 제, 제가 잘 해낼 수 있어요!","source_cn":"请放心，我、我可以的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A5314D83AF4D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421239013:1":{"text":"다른 보물은... 전부 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께 드리는 걸로 하지요.","source_cn":"至于其他的宝物，<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB614E2B1128FAD82","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다른 보물은... 전부 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께 드리는 걸로 하지요.","female":"다른 보물은... 전부 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께 드리는 걸로 하지요.","variant_male_record_index":"163417","variant_female_record_index":"163418","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1421239013":{"text":"다른 보물은... 전부 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께 드리는 걸로 하지요.","source_cn":"至于其他的宝物，<style=stress><player_name></style>，都给你吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB614E2B1128FAD82","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다른 보물은... 전부 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께 드리는 걸로 하지요.","female":"다른 보물은... 전부 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께 드리는 걸로 하지요.","variant_male_record_index":"163417","variant_female_record_index":"163418","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421239014:1":{"text":"이건 전부 셀로클랜드의 특색이 담겨져 있으니...","source_cn":"这些都是萨洛克兰本地的特色……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAEAB7C3CB0E8160E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이건 전부 셀로클랜드의 특색이 담겨져 있으니...","female":"이건 전부 셀로클랜드의 특색이 담겨져 있으니...","variant_male_record_index":"163419","variant_female_record_index":"163420","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421239015:1":{"text":"이걸 가지고 계시면...","source_cn":"拿着这些吧，这样你就不会忘记……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x24A655F4A5446801","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이걸 가지고 계시면...","female":"이걸 가지고 계시면...","variant_male_record_index":"163421","variant_female_record_index":"163422","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421239016:0":{"text":"당신이 만났던, 아주 사랑스러웠던 페리엘이라는 고위 제사장을 잊지 않으실 테니까요.","source_cn":"你曾遇见过一个可爱的高级祭司——斐利尔。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xACE85E237A4EB773","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"당신이 만났던, 아주 사랑스러웠던 페리엘이라는 고위 제사장을 잊지 않으실 테니까요.","female":"당신이 만났던, 아주 사랑스러웠던 페리엘이라는 고위 제사장을 잊지 않으실 테니까요.","variant_male_record_index":"163423","variant_female_record_index":"163424","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:19:1421239017:0":{"text":"어디로 여행을 가든, 시간이 어떻게 흘러가든...","source_cn":"你知道，无论你的旅途将去何方，无论时光如何流转……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0CE772C9F23CA17D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어디로 여행을 가든, 시간이 어떻게 흘러가든...","female":"어디로 여행을 가든, 시간이 어떻게 흘러가든...","variant_male_record_index":"163425","variant_female_record_index":"163426","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:20:1421239018:0":{"text":"영원히 페리엘을 잊지 못할 것이다.","source_cn":"你永远——都会记得斐利尔。","status":